You must run the orientdb service once to initialize this node.

# cd /etc/sv/orientdb
# sudo ./run

Then you may enable the orientdb service

# sv-enable orientdb

With slinit, run its helper once as the orientdb user instead:

# sudo -u orientdb /usr/libexec/slinit/orientdb

Then enable the service with

# slinitctl enable orientdb

Its options (DAEMON, OPTS) go in /etc/conf.d/orientdb.
